data.reasoningText:
The MSTest 3.8.2 SDK doesn't have `Assert.StartsWith`, `Assert.EndsWith`, or `Assert.MatchesRegex` as static methods on `Assert`. These are newer APIs. Let me check what version has them, or if they need `StringAssert` instead.

Looking at the skill doc, it says these are available:
```csharp
Assert.StartsWith("prefix", actualString);
Assert.EndsWith("suffix", actualString);
Assert.MatchesRegex(@"\d{3}-\d{4}", phoneNumber);
